@MesIngestHost = http://localhost:5088
@sharedSecret = replace-with-shared-secret
@demandSeriesSnapshot = replace-with-DemandSeries-snapshotReference
@demandSeriesNextCursor = replace-with-DemandSeries-nextCursor
@readabilityAuditSnapshot = replace-with-ReadabilityAudit-snapshotReference
@readabilityAuditNextCursor = replace-with-ReadabilityAudit-nextCursor
@errorSearchSnapshot = replace-with-ErrorSearch-snapshotReference
@errorSearchNextCursor = replace-with-ErrorSearch-nextCursor
@catalogEtag = "replace-with-etag-from-the-catalog-response"
@seriesId = replace-with-seriesId
@demandId = replace-with-demandId
@evidenceId = replace-with-evidenceId
@pollTraceId = replace-with-pollTraceId
@hostSessionId = replace-with-hostSessionId
@workType = WIRE_TO_NITROGEN
@sublot = SL-EXAMPLE-001

# V2 business operations are read-only GETs. Loopback reads do not need a
# bearer token. Add `Authorization: Bearer {{sharedSecret}}` to every request
# when Host is bound beyond loopback; restricted raw evidence always requires it.
#
# DemandSeries, ReadabilityAudit, and ErrorSearch lists default to pageSize=100
# and reject pageSize above 200. A first list request obtains snapshotReference
# and nextCursor. Each list owns its snapshot and cursor; never reuse them across
# capabilities. URL-encode and reuse a list's values together for cursor paging:
# snapshot identifies immutable facts; cursor identifies the next position in
# that same snapshot/filter/order. Neither value is a catalog ETag.

### Get the exact V2 contract identity and stable capability set
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/contract
Accept: application/json

### Read the approved maximum historical box count for one exact SUBLOT
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/sublot-box-count?sublot={{sublot}}
Accept: application/json

### Get the canonical V2 OpenAPI document
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/openapi/v2.json
Accept: application/json

### List DemandSeries — first page (default 100, maximum 200)
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/demand-series?presence=VISIBLE&area=A1-1&pageSize=100&page=1&order=STARTED_AT_DESC_SERIES_ID_ASC
Accept: application/json

### Resolve one DemandSeries by its exact transport key in a chosen snapshot
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/demand-series/by-key?workType={{workType}}&sublot={{sublot}}&snapshot={{demandSeriesSnapshot}}
Accept: application/json

### Get one DemandSeries from the same immutable snapshot
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/demand-series/{{seriesId}}?snapshot={{demandSeriesSnapshot}}
Accept: application/json

### Read the complete externally readable Demand catalog
# Copy the response ETag into @catalogEtag.
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/externally-readable-demand-catalog
Accept: application/json

### Read the catalog conditionally; returns 304 when CatalogRevision is unchanged
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/externally-readable-demand-catalog
Accept: application/json
If-None-Match: {{catalogEtag}}

### List the independent ReadabilityAudit snapshot — first page
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/readability-audit?state=NOT_READABLE&area=N3-3&pageSize=100&page=1&order=NOT_READABLE_FIRST_LEAD_PRIORITY_DEMAND_LAST_SEEN_DESC_DEMAND_ID_ASC
Accept: application/json

### Get one ReadabilityAudit record from that audit snapshot
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/readability-audit/{{demandId}}?snapshot={{readabilityAuditSnapshot}}
Accept: application/json

### Search Series errors — first page with an event-time window
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/error-search?state=ACTIVE&window=LAST_7_DAYS&pageSize=100
Accept: application/json

### Get one error-search Series detail from the same error snapshot
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/error-search/{{seriesId}}?snapshot={{errorSearchSnapshot}}
Accept: application/json

### Read explicitly selected, bounded raw evidence (always authorized)
# maxItems is 1..20; each item is capped at 2,048 bytes and the response at 65,536 bytes.
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/error-search/{{seriesId}}/evidence/{{evidenceId}}/raw-observations?snapshot={{errorSearchSnapshot}}&fields=workType,sublot,area,eqp,step,mesSourceDate,package&maxItems=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedSecret}}

### Read the bounded current operational attention page (default 100, maximum 200)
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/current-ingest-attention?kind=SERIES_ERROR&severity=ERROR&pageSize=100&pageNumber=1
Accept: application/json

### Read one atomic WatchOverviewSnapshot for selected MES areas
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/watch-overview?area=A1-1&area=N3-3
Accept: application/json

### Read health and causal evidence for one PollTrace
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/poll-traces/{{pollTraceId}}
Accept: application/json

### Read the current absence-authority state
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/absence-authority
Accept: application/json

### Read absence authority for one Host session
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/absence-authority/{{hostSessionId}}
Accept: application/json

### List all task-type protection decisions
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/task-type-protections
Accept: application/json

### Read the protection decision for one exact work type
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/task-type-protections/{{workType}}
Accept: application/json

### Cursor paging example — keep snapshot, filter, page size, and order unchanged
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/demand-series?presence=VISIBLE&area=A1-1&pageSize=100&order=STARTED_AT_DESC_SERIES_ID_ASC&snapshot={{demandSeriesSnapshot}}&cursor={{demandSeriesNextCursor}}
Accept: application/json

### ReadabilityAudit cursor — bound only to its own snapshot/filter/order
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/readability-audit?state=NOT_READABLE&area=N3-3&pageSize=100&order=NOT_READABLE_FIRST_LEAD_PRIORITY_DEMAND_LAST_SEEN_DESC_DEMAND_ID_ASC&snapshot={{readabilityAuditSnapshot}}&cursor={{readabilityAuditNextCursor}}
Accept: application/json

### ErrorSearch cursor — bound only to its own event snapshot/filter/window/order
GET {{MesIngestHost}}/api/v2/error-search?state=ACTIVE&window=LAST_7_DAYS&pageSize=100&snapshot={{errorSearchSnapshot}}&cursor={{errorSearchNextCursor}}
Accept: application/json
